OL,3,GNEWSA'Unsung hero' binman immortalised
OL,4,Ain pub mural
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of a seaside town's unsung heroes
OL,7,Fhas been immortalised with his own
OL,8,Fmural on a pub.
OL,10,FKenny Dunn, 70, has kept the seafront
OL,11,Fclean at New Brighton in Wirral for the
OL,12,Flast nine years and the man responsible
OL,13,Ffor the area's regeneration decided it
OL,14,Fwas time to recognise him on the wall
OL,15,Fof the James Atherton pub.
OL,17,F"It's fantastic, I'm overwhelmed its
OL,18,Freally special to me and my family as
OL,19,Fwell - they have said I'm a superstar,"
OL,20,Fsaid Dunn.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
