OL,5,
OL,6,F"I was hoping it wouldn't look like
OL,7,Fthat Ronaldo statue," he added, in a
OL,8,Fjoke reference to the tribute to
OL,9,FCristiano Ronaldo at Madeira Airport
OL,10,Fwhich was mocked by some.
